# Script archives embed Go sources and golden output that the tests compare
# byte-for-byte against rewriter output, which emits LF. Force LF on checkout
# so the comparisons hold on Windows runners (Git for Windows defaults to
# autocrlf=true and would otherwise yield CRLF).
*.txtar text eol=lf
*.go text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
